BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Always A Little Bit Tipsy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T220000
UID:fb573732dd9738f0c9ec9bb28742accb@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:A radiant little boy\, fearless in his tenderness and joy\, le
 arns too early that the world has rules about what a “man” should be. 
 Shamed into conformity\, he armors himself in a hard\, brittle masculinity
 —trading empathy for approval\, wonder for performance. The cost is stee
 p: he becomes everything he once feared — disconnected\, abrasive\, holl
 ow.\nYears later\, he stumbles into drag—a world where exaggeration reve
 als truth—and discovers the parts of himself he had to hide are the very
  source of his power. Through performance\, he reclaims the exiled parts o
 f himself—the softness\, the play\, the truth—and begins to stitch tog
 ether a fuller\, freer person.\nThis is a story about the violence of smal
 l shames\, the masks we build to survive\, and the radical\, glittering ac
 t of becoming whole because all of us have a little bit of Tipsy in us jus
 t begging to break free.\nAlways a Little Bit Tipsy is an original work wr
 itten by Tom Slater\, Nicholas Krohn\, and Ryan Chase and starring Tom Sla
 ter as Tipsy Teasedale!
GEO:39.1657967;-86.5339376
LOCATION:Waldron Arts Center\, 122 S. Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN 474
 04
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/always-a-little-bit-tipsy/59151
 /
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
