 ture. A four-day festival for people of all ages\, ethnicities\, abilities
 \, and backgrounds that is supported by countless community partners\, spo
 nsors\, and volunteers.\n Lotus showcases artists and groups from around t
 he globe where you can expect unique opportunities and experiences that ma
 y broaden your worldview through the arts.\n Distinguished among other mus
 ic festivals\, Lotus Fest presents a non-hierarchical mix of performers an
