UID:f951f8adf570e4f44bd5ef0a15198b9e@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Nevere is the brightest young witch at Spellwright School for 
 Wizardry\, she's got her best friend Taolo\, a slightly annoying familiar 
 Cletus\, and her loving-if-out-of-touch mom--so why does she feel like som
 ething is really wrong? After a school assembly about the dangers of love 
 potions\, Nevere snatches her professor's spell book\, just a week before 
 the Spring Fling. While giving someone else a love potion may be kinda dic
 ey\, what if you could make a love potion . . . for yourself? \nDirected b
 y Andrew Keeler\nMusic Direction by Kyla Sherry\nChoreographed by Jada Bue
 hler\nBook By Annalise Cain\nMusic by Devin McDuffy\nLyrics By Annalise Ca
 in and Devin McDuffy\n​\nIn the fall of 2025\, Stages Bloomington presen
 ted a staged concert reading of the never-before-seen musical with 8 Bloom
 ington teens. We're so excited to be staging the world premiere of this mu
 sical!\n​
GEO:39.17030940000001;-86.534054
