BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gallery Walk - Bound by Nature
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T200000
UID:0fb5fefff82e1a978579981b0086710f@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:First Friday Gallery Walk\, Oct 2\, 5-8:00pm\nSpecial music by
  Elias Fisher\, 6-7:30pm\nBound by Nature is a commissioned series of twen
 ty original Art Nouveau-inspired illustrations created for the wedding of 
 Erica Nadolkski and Jordan Evans.\nEach poster celebrates a different inse
 ct personally selected by the bride\, pairing it with native flora and ele
 ments of its natural habitat. Drawing inspiration from vintage natural his
 tory plates and the decorative compositions of the Art Nouveau movement\, 
 every illustration is framed by ornamental motifs unique to its featured s
 pecies\, incorporating elements from its life cycle\, host plants\, and su
 rrounding ecosystem.\nOriginally designed as table markers for the couple
 ’s wedding reception\, the complete series extends beyond its ceremonial
  purpose as a celebration of transformation\, growth\, and the interconnec
 tedness of nature. Like marriage itself\, metamorphosis is a process of co
 ntinual change. Reflected throughout the lives of the insects depicted in 
 these illustrations.\nFollowing the wedding\, the collection will be exhib
 ited at Juniper Gallery in October as a complete body of work with reprodu
 ctions available.
GEO:39.1664355;-86.5405013
LOCATION:Juniper Art Gallery\, 615 West Kirkwood Avenue\, Bloomington\, IN
  47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/gallery-walk-bound-by-nature/59
 909/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
