UID:a4bed8a4f8683a67a6a3c3ada7a1243b@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow’s Sentry: One forgotten trunk. One extraordinary li
 fe. One community’s untold story.\nWhen 102-year-old Bloomington residen
 t Dot Weaver dies\, she left behind fragments of a hidden history waiting 
 to be discovered. Audiences are taken on an unforgettable journey though M
 onroe County’s controversial history — from the post Civil War era to 
