 o a winner-take-all championship round. The champions walk away with an ep
 ic prize: a hot air balloon ride!\nWe only have room for 8 teams this year
 \, so if you want in\, don't wait too long to sign up.\nFriends and family
  are welcome to come watch too\, no ticket needed. There will be live musi
 c from 3-5pm\, food trucks Pili's Party Taco and Flam'n Grill will here se
 rving up local favorites\, and wine specials. Come out\, enjoy the day and
  cheer on your favorite team!\nRound 1 starts at 3:30pm\, Round 2 at 4:30p
 m\, and the championship round at 5pm. There's also a prize for Best Team 
