DESCRIPTION:Join us Saturday\, October 3 for the oldest and largest 5K eve
 nt in Indiana\, starting and finishing on the North side of Simon Skjodt A
 ssembly Hall!\n Hoosiers Outrun Cancer is a community celebration of all t
 he amazing people (we all know someone) who have faced cancer in our commu
 nity. Teams are formed around people being honored or remembered to show o
 ur collective support and the strength in our community when we all work t
 ogether.\n 100% of the proceeds raised from Hoosiers Outrun Cancer provide
  free cancer support services to anyone impacted by cancer (patients\, sur
 vivors\, families\, caregivers\, and friends). These supports include coun
 seling\, health and wellness classes\, therapy\, social activities and eve
 nts\, direct financial assistance\, and so much more.\n Funds raised from 
 past Hoosiers Outrun Cancer events made it possible to open a new Cancer S
 upport Community location in Bloomington\, Indiana located at 1719 W 3rd S
 treet\, so that no one faces cancer alone in our community!\n Thank you fo
 r running with us!
