BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maya\, Give Me a Title | Adapt/Contruct\, CINEKid's International 
 Children's Film Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261003T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261003T170000
UID:6d8e1451e3a691b4056b57ea13fcaa83@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Maya and her dad—producer and filmmaker Michel Gondry—live
  in two different countries. In order to stay in touch\, her dad asks her 
 every evening\, “Maya\, give me a title.” Based on her answer\, he cre
 ates a short animated reply in which Maya is the hero. In this charming an
 d clever stop-motion animated adventure\, the always innovative and whimsi
 cal Gondry brings to life a poetic and amusing journey that will have the 
 little ones dreaming and the grown-ups smiling. [61 min\; animation\, adve
 nture\, family\; French with English subtitles]\nBefore the screening\, jo
 in us at 3pm in our lower lobby for a fun flipbook-making activity! Then\,
  on October 24\, come to the IU Sciences Library (located inside the Chemi
 stry Building at 800 E. Kirkwood Ave.) anytime between 10am-4pm for a hand
 s-on investigation into how things move. Show them your IU Cinema flipbook
  for a special sticker and goodie bag! All ages are invited to explore boo
 ks on animation\, physics\, and other fun science-in-motion topics from th
 e Education Library\, then test your skills with mechanical puzzles from t
 he Lilly Library's Slocum Puzzle Collection. Don't miss the chance to make
  your very own thaumatrope\, a classic optical toy that brings still image
 s to life! Plus\, enjoy the button maker and take home a craft to remember
  your visit. It’s all part of ScienceFest 2026\, a campus-wide celebrati
 on of science at Indiana University.
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/maya-give-me-a-title-adaptcontr
 uct-cinekids-international-childrens-film-series/59837/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
