 ion will be held at Indiana University’s Grunwald Gallery of Art in Bloo
 mington\, IN from August 25-October 31\, 2026. Exhibiting artists are elig
 ible for four awards recognizing excellence in artistic practice. \n"Futur
 e Tense” celebrates the creative work of student artists\, designers\, a
