BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FAUST/FAUST: EINE DEUTSCHE VOLKSSAGE w/ live music | Friday Night 
 Frights
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261013T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261013T204500
UID:785521d2a6902b6dafcd87ad1088fd61@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:The Ufa-produced\, silent fantasy film starring Emil Jannings 
 that is a hallmark of Murnau's oeuvre and follows the demon Mephisto as he
  wagers with God that he can corrupt a mortal man's soul. [107 min\; drama
 \, fantasy\, horror\; German intertitles with English translation]\nThe fi
 lm will be accompanied by a live score from Minneapolis' ten thousand lake
 s (xkl). ten thousand lakes are Peter Bruhn (percussive and electronic ins
 truments and noises) and Steven Larsen (stringed and electronic instrument
 s and noises). Their influences are numerous\, and not limited to music al
 one. Visual art\, film\, dance\, poetry\, and literature all inform their 
 approach to creativity\, as does formative years performing in a European-
 based shoe-gaze band and an indie-rock band in the Midwest. xkl regularly 
 composes and performs scores to accompany features accompanying avantgarde
  and experimental films from the first half of the 20th century.
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/faustfaust-eine-deutsche-volkss
 age-w-live-music-friday-night-frights/59844/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
