BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ballet Hispanico New York - Carmen Maquia
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261014T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261014T213000
UID:0c455fe42f57bedc961cfb8f7e1fe5d9@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Ballet Hispánico New York is the nation’s leading American 
 Latino dance company and the largest cultural institution of its kind in t
 he United States. For over five decades\, it has been a beacon of artistic
  excellence\, celebrated for its bold repertory and exceptional training p
 rograms.\n The Bloomington performance will be an evening-length presentat
 ion of CARMEN.maquia. Since the debut in 1875\, Carmen\, the titular chara
 cter from Bizet’s opera\, has become a timeless cultural icon\, inspirin
 g generations of composers\, choreographers\, and writers to attempt to ca
 pture her elusive and alluring nature.\n Ballet Hispánico honors the powe
 rful Spanish leading lady with Gustavo Ramírez Sansano’s electrifying C
 ARMEN.maquia. One of today’s most sought-after choreographers\, Sansano
 ’s quintessential ballet invigorates this timeless tale with an unrelent
 ing energy that leaves you breathless. Highly original and full of explosi
 ve movement\, CARMEN.maquia is a bold reimagining of this tragic tale.
GEO:39.1684021;-86.5178918
LOCATION:Indiana University Auditorium\, 1211 E 7th St\, Bloomington\, IN 
 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/ballet-hispanico-new-york-carme
 n-maquia/58928/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Night Out - Second Wednesdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261014T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261014T200000
UID:34043cb61026e63c823493d7b5d6fb07@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Family Night Out is a monthly block party designed for easy\, 
 low-pressure community connection right in the heart of downtown.\nOn the 
 second Wednesday of every month from 5:30–8pm\, Kirkwood Avenue in front
  of the Monroe County Public Library transforms into a shared dining room 
 and open-air gathering space. Bring your people\, grab takeout from partic
 ipating local restaurants offering special deals\, and sit down together a
 t long family-style tables set right in the middle of the street.\nAlong t
 he block you’ll find local art vendors\, community partners hosting hand
 s-on activities\, and a rotating lineup of buskers filling the air with li
 ve music. The Front Porch Trailer brings casual lawn games and extra space
  to hang out\, play\, and linger a little longer.\nIt’s part dinner\, pa
 rt street fair\, part neighborhood hangout. Come eat\, wander\, play\, and
  stay awhile.
GEO:39.1669872;-86.5303618
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library\, 303 E. Kirkwood Avenue\, Bloomingt
 on\, IN 47408
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/family-night-out-second-wednesd
 ays/59611/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
