UID:9dabc42ab25071441787b81613e1354a@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Epic in form\, intimate in scope\, and set in the forests of E
 astern Siberia at the turn of the century\, Dersu Uzala is a moving story 
 of the friendship that grows between an aging hunter and a Russian surveyo
 r. Based on a memoir by renowned Russian explorer Vladimir Klavdiyevich Ar
 senyev\, Kurosawa's romantic hymn to nature and the human spirit is perhap
 s the most persuasive argument for the immense power of nature and the bea
 uty found in simplicity. [142 min\; adventure\, drama\; Russian and Mandar
 in with English subtitles]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/dersu-uzala-michael-a-mcrobbies
 -choice/59855/
