END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:It Was Just An Accident | Arthouse Now
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261018T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261018T174500
UID:34ea6493096adc480ea9d3fc8158b491@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Mechanic Vahid is jarringly reminded of his time in an Iranian
  prison for being branded a "dissident" when he has a chance encounter wit
 h Eghbal\, a man he strongly suspects to be his sadistic jailhouse captor.
  Panicked\, Vahid rounds up some of his fellow ex-prisoners to try and con
 firm Eghbal's identity and determine what to do next. Panahi creates a dee
 ply felt moral thriller\, combining high stakes tension with unexpected hu
 mor and thoughtful\, yet devastating\, questions regarding persecution and
  revenge. [103 min\; thriller\, drama\; Persian with English subtitles]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
