BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:IU Creative Collaborations Meet & Mix | Additional Films and Guest
 s
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261019T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261019T183000
UID:966feb09e01771a45936e9d098f9eb91@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Be a part of making film for all possible! Join us for our ann
 ual Meet & Mix at The Vault Pub to explore our Creative Collaborations pro
 gram opportunities. Space limited\, R.S.V.P. required.\nAbout IU Cinema Cr
 eative Collaborations Meet & Mix\nIf you are interested in applying for ou
 r next round of Creative Collaborations\, taking place in 2027–28\, this
  is the session for you! Learn more about the program\, meet potential pro
 gramming partners\, and enjoy tasty hors d’oeuvres at The Vault Pub.\nCr
 eative Collaborations enables groups at IU and in our community to highlig
 ht important topics and ideas through film screenings and film-related edu
 cational programs. The mission of Creative Collaborations is to:\nFoster d
 iverse programming partnerships that help bridge campus and community\nHig
 hlight critical issues and themes through film-related and educational pro
 grams curated in collaboration with IU Cinema and subject-matter experts\n
 Welcome new and returning audiences to IU Cinema\nApplications for 2027–
 28 program proposals will be accepted from October 8–November 20\, 2026.
  Full program guidelines are available at go.iu.edu/creativecollaborations
 .\nSpace for this Meet & Mix is limited. R.S.V.P. required.\nPast Partner 
 Tip #1: "Be specific in your focus\, build coalitions of support\, and hav
 e speakers that inspire attendance."\nPast Partner Tip #2: "Select a topic
  that appeals to campus stakeholders\, make sure the event is well publici
 zed\, and integrate the series with courses."\nPast Partner Tip #3: "I fou
 nd the process to be relatively simple\, so I would encourage people to ta
 ke the risk. The staff at IU Cinema is a pleasure to work with."
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/iu-creative-collaborations-meet
 -mix-additional-films-and-guests/59856/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
