 demic as New Zealand’s youngest female leader. By balancing immense poli
 tical pressure with first-time motherhood\, she redefines global leadershi
 p through an empathetic yet resolute approach. Packed with raw audio diari
 es and candid footage\, this film delivers a powerful\, inspiring portrait
  of a woman who proved that vulnerability and unyielding strength can rewr
 ite the rules of power. [101 min\; documentary\; English]\nA Q&A will foll
 ow the screening.
