 s\, a tree raffle\, and a volunteer shout out to appreciate all of the wor
 k our volunteers have done with our organization.\n5:30 p.m. — Food\, ga
 mes & festivities begin\n6:30 p.m. — Remarks\, community shoutouts & tre
 e raffle\n7:00 p.m. — Settle in for The Lorax\nFor more information and 
 to let us know you can come to the celebration\, visit: https://www.canopy
 bloomington.org/
