DESCRIPTION:Experience the heroism of My Hero Academia In Concert\, celebr
 ating 10 years of unforgettable adventures! From Deku’s first steps to t
 he thrilling battles\, this live concert brings the anime’s full eight-s
 eason journey to life on stage. Accompanied by an 15-piece live band perfo
 rming Yuki Hayashi’s iconic score perfectly synced with striking visuals
  of your favorite scenes\, every note captures the triumph\, heartbreak\, 
 and courage of Class 1-A creating an immersive concert experience for fans
  new and old alike.\nFeel the ultimate hero energy as the stage comes aliv
 e with inspiring characters\, epic moments\, and emotional storytelling fr
 om all eight seasons. Whether you’ve followed Deku and his classmates fr
 om the beginning or are discovering the world of heroes for the first time
 \, this concert is a musical adventure you won’t want to miss.\nCelebrat
 e 10 years of My Hero Academia and join us for an unforgettable evening of
  music\, action\, and heart!
GEO:39.1684021;-86.5178918
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
