 ore hands-on triangle challenges\, math-inspired art\, and puzzles through
 out the museum\, and discover how one ancient theorem still shows up every
 where — from architecture to nature to the numbers on today's calendar.\
 nEmbrace the endless creativity of mathematics. Join us at WonderLab for P
 ythagorean Theorem Day — a once-in-a-lifetime date when the calendar doe
 s the math for you: 10-24-26 means 10² + 24² = 26².
