BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Postmodern Panic: Meta Horror Double Feature with Scream + Cabin i
 n the Woods | Friday Night Frights
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T013000
UID:7a0bc05d20e8c332dd8ab1d426e75302@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Snacks\, drinks in resealable/enclosed containers (there are n
 o cupholders in the Cinema!)\, and finger foods that do not emit a strong 
 odor or make a mess are allowed for this double feature. Alcohol\, cigaret
 tes\, electronic cigarettes\, and illicit drugs are prohibited at IU Cinem
 a.\nAbout Postmodern Panic: Meta-Horror Double Feature with Scream + Cabin
  in the Woods\nScream (Wes Craven\, USA\, 1996): The horror blockbuster th
 at jumpstarted a franchise that is still going strong\, Scream follows a s
 eries of mysterious deaths in a small town as an offbeat group of friends 
 become the target of a masked killer. As the body count rises\, the kids m
 ust learn "the rules" of horror films to survive. [111 min\; horror\; Engl
 ish]\nCabin in the Woods (Drew Goddard\, USA\, 2011): When five college fr
 iends arrive at a remote forest vacation cabin\, little do they expect the
  horrors that await them. One by one\, they fall victim to backwoods zombi
 es\, soon discovering that there is more going on than meets the eye. [95 
 min\; horror\; English]
