DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T203000
UID:9625f1662302570f34dd9f367034941a@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Kyanite Broom Workshop\nA little magic\, a little wire\, and a
  whole lot of witchy fun.\nIn this hands-on workshop\, you’ll learn the 
 art of wire wrapping while creating your very own kyanite crystal broom. K
 yanite is a beautiful stone often associated with balance\, alignment\, ca
 lming energy\, and clearing energetic blockages. It’s traditionally beli
 eved to help promote a sense of tranquility and strengthen meditation and 
 intuition.\nWe’ll wrap a piece of natural kyanite in wire and transform 
 it into a tiny magical broom that you can carry\, display\, keep on your a
 ltar or put on a chain. The finished piece is the perfect little talisman 
 for the season of All Hallows Eve\, when the veil feels a little thinner a
 nd a little more magic is in the air.\nNo previous wire-wrapping experienc
 e is needed. Just bring yourself\, your curiosity\, and your inner witch. 
 All materials are provided.\nCome make something beautiful\, learn a new s
 kill\, and leave with your very own kyanite broom to sweep a little magic 
 into your world.
GEO:39.1671921;-86.5334276
LOCATION:Gather :handmade shoppe & co.:\, 116 N. Walnut Street\, Bloomingt
 on\, IN 47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/wire-wrapped-wonders-kyanite-br
 oom-pendant-with-poesis-payne/59902/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
