 ror\; Japanese with English subtitles]\nGozu (Takashi Miike\, Japan\, 2003
 ): Acclaimed director Takashi Miike's unhinged Yakuza/horror film continue
 s to shock and amaze audiences decades after its original release. Minami 
 is sent to kill his mentor Ozaki (who is in the midst of a nervous breakdo
 wn) but soon finds the simple hit quickly morphs into a terrifying and vis
 ceral journey into the unexplained and unknown. One of the films in Miike'
 s oeuvre that continues to confound and haunt audiences\, which is saying 
 something! [129 min\; horror\; Japanese with English subtitles]
