UID:c3b371b75879b8f9cc9d964f05190027@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:WonderLab's Science of Art series is teaming up with Discardia
 \, a project of the Center for Sustainable Living\, for something a little
  different: Science of Art: Stitched & Salvaged.\nTurns out mending is bas
 ically a science experiment in disguise. Drop in and get hands-on with the
  math\, materials\, and hidden creativity behind fixing what's torn\, worn
 \, or written off too soon — and discover how a needle and thread can be
