 rfect for bringing a little handmade charm to your home for the cozy seaso
 n.\nYou’ll learn the basics from start to finish\, including how to get 
 your project started\, make your cross stitches\, follow the pattern\, and
  finish your piece so it’s ready to hang and enjoy.\nNo experience is ne
 eded. Just come ready to slow down\, learn something new\, and spend a lit
 tle time making something cute.\nAll materials are included. Class size: 1
 –5 participants\nCome stitch a little\, chat a little\, and make your ow
 n Pumpkin Kitty!\nAll workshops are non-refundable.
