BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tarot Readings with Scott Kellogg on Saturdays at oak.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T160000
UID:9beddaf8c55a1fda30023eec07fb3cf8@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Beginning February 14\, Oak welcomes Scott Kellogg as our resi
 dent tarot reader. With over twenty years of experience as a tarot practit
 ioner\, teacher\, and community builder\, Scott offers readings that are i
 ntuitive\, thoughtful\, and deeply attuned to the person across the table.
 \nHis work gently explores your inner landscape\, your emotions\, desires\
 , and the unseen patterns shaping your life. These sessions are less about
  prediction and more about remembrance\, helping you reconnect with your i
 nner knowing and the quiet wisdom you already carry.\nScott holds space wi
 th care\, curiosity\, and respect\, creating a grounded and welcoming expe
 rience for women and femme centered seekers at every stage of life. A read
 ing with Scott invites clarity\, reassurance\, and a sense of being truly 
 seen.
