BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tarot Readings with Scott Kellogg on Saturdays at oak.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261219T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261219T160000
UID:13bfe0096d103fe74a045e740dc76a7a@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Beginning February 14\, Oak welcomes Scott Kellogg as our resi
 dent tarot reader. With over twenty years of experience as a tarot practit
 ioner\, teacher\, and community builder\, Scott offers readings that are i
 ntuitive\, thoughtful\, and deeply attuned to the person across the table.
 \nHis work gently explores your inner landscape\, your emotions\, desires\
 , and the unseen patterns shaping your life. These sessions are less about
  prediction and more about remembrance\, helping you reconnect with your i
 nner knowing and the quiet wisdom you already carry.\nScott holds space wi
 th care\, curiosity\, and respect\, creating a grounded and welcoming expe
 rience for women and femme centered seekers at every stage of life. A read
 ing with Scott invites clarity\, reassurance\, and a sense of being truly 
 seen.
GEO:39.167879;-86.53442559999999
LOCATION:oak.\, 116 W 6th Street\, Suite 101\, Bloomington\, IN 47401
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/tarot-readings-with-scott-kello
 gg-on-saturdays-at-oak/57842/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Krampus Bizaar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T180000
UID:22e6754978c8603fd574f16d8f3bf449@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Can you hear the bells? Can you hear the hooves clacking throu
 gh the streets? It's that time again - KRAMPUS COMES TO BLOOMINGTON. Join 
 us for the Krampus Bizaar\, where you can find whimsical vendors\, spooky 
 items\, naughty elves\, angels spreading cheer and much more. We will have
  35+ vendors setup at the pavilion in Switchyard Park along with food vend
 ors and all manner of roaming critters.\nThis is a free-to-attend\, kid-fr
 iendly event to help support local makers and keep the spirit of Krampus a
 live. This time of year we are thinking about gifts and what we want to ta
 ke into the next year\, but it's also an opportunity to get in tune with o
 ur ancestors and those who have passed on. Come down for an oracle\, rune\
 , or tarot reading\, get some reiki healing and prepare yourself to tuck i
 n for those long winter nights.
GEO:39.1476298;-86.5384061
LOCATION:Switchyard Park\, 1601 S. Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47403
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/krampus-bizaar/59600/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
